<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

		<!-- Favicon -->
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/icon.svg" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/icon-32.png" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="/icon-16.png" />
		<link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="/apple-touch-icon.png" />

		<!-- Primary Meta Tags -->
		<title>Guides - Unslop Search</title>
		<meta name="title" content="Guides - Disable AI Overview on Google & Other Search Engines" />
		<meta name="description" content="Learn how to disable AI overviews on Google, DuckDuckGo, and Brave. Guides for using udm=14, browser extensions, and AI-free search engines." />

		<!-- Open Graph -->
		<meta property="og:type" content="website" />
		<meta property="og:url" content="https://unslopsearch.com/guides" />
		<meta property="og:title" content="Guides - Disable AI Overview on Google & Other Search Engines" />
		<meta property="og:description" content="Learn how to disable AI overviews on Google, DuckDuckGo, and Brave. Guides for using udm=14, browser extensions, and AI-free search engines." />
		<link rel="canonical" href="https://unslopsearch.com/guides/" />
	</head>
	<body>
		<div class="container">
			<a href="/" class="back-link">&larr; Back to Unslop Search</a>

			<h1>Guides</h1>
			<p class="intro">Everything you need to search without AI overviews.</p>

			<div class="guides-grid">
				<a href="/guides/disable-ai-overview-google" class="guide-card">
					<span class="guide-icon">
						<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
							<circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle>
							<path d="M21 21l-4.35-4.35"></path>
							<path d="M8 8l6 6M14 8l-6 6" stroke="#ff6b6b"></path>
						</svg>
					</span>
					<h2>Disable AI Overview on Google</h2>
					<p>Step-by-step methods to remove AI summaries from your Google search results.</p>
					<span class="guide-tag popular">Most Popular</span>
				</a>

				<a href="/guides/best-private-search-engines" class="guide-card">
					<span class="guide-icon">
						<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
							<path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
						</svg>
					</span>
					<h2>Best Private Search Engines</h2>
					<p>Compare privacy-focused alternatives: DuckDuckGo, Startpage, Brave, and more.</p>
					<span class="guide-tag">Privacy</span>
				</a>

				<a href="/guides/set-default-search-engine" class="guide-card">
					<span class="guide-icon">
						<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
							<circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle>
							<path d="M19.4 15a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33 1.82l.06.06a2 2 0 0 1 0 2.83 2 2 0 0 1-2.83 0l-.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82-.33 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1 1.51V21a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 9 19.4a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82.33l-.06.06a2 2 0 0 1-2.83 0 2 2 0 0 1 0-2.83l.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33-1.82 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51-1H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2 2 2 0 0 1 2-2h.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 4.6 9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33-1.82l-.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 0-2.83 2 2 0 0 1 2.83 0l.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82.33H9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1-1.51V3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2 2 2 0 0 1 2 2v.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1 1.51 1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82-.33l.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 2.83 0 2 2 0 0 1 0 2.83l-.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33 1.82V9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.51 1H21a2 2 0 0 1 2 2 2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51 1z"></path>
						</svg>
					</span>
					<h2>Set Default Search Engine</h2>
					<p>How to change your default search in Chrome, Firefox, Safari, and Edge.</p>
					<span class="guide-tag">Setup</span>
				</a>

				<a href="/guides/duckduckgo-vs-google" class="guide-card">
					<span class="guide-icon">
						<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
							<path d="M18 20V10"></path>
							<path d="M12 20V4"></path>
							<path d="M6 20v-6"></path>
						</svg>
					</span>
					<h2>DuckDuckGo vs Google</h2>
					<p>Privacy, search quality, and features compared side-by-side.</p>
					<span class="guide-tag">Comparison</span>
				</a>

				<a href="/guides/what-is-udm14" class="guide-card">
					<span class="guide-icon">
						<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
							<polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"></polyline>
							<polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"></polyline>
						</svg>
					</span>
					<h2>What is udm=14?</h2>
					<p>The technical deep-dive on Google's hidden parameter for classic search results.</p>
					<span class="guide-tag">Technical</span>
				</a>

				<a href="/guides/search-engines-without-ai" class="guide-card">
					<span class="guide-icon">
						<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
							<rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7"></rect>
							<rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7"></rect>
							<rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7"></rect>
							<rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7"></rect>
						</svg>
					</span>
					<h2>Search Engines Without AI</h2>
					<p>Compare alternatives: DuckDuckGo, Brave, Startpage, Qwant, Mojeek, and more.</p>
					<span class="guide-tag">Comparison</span>
				</a>

				<a href="/guides/startpage-search-engine" class="guide-card">
					<span class="guide-icon">
						<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
							<circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
							<line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"></line>
							<path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"></path>
						</svg>
					</span>
					<h2>Startpage Search Engine</h2>
					<p>Google results with complete privacy - no tracking, no AI.</p>
					<span class="guide-tag">Engine Guide</span>
				</a>

				<a href="/guides/qwant-search-engine" class="guide-card">
					<span class="guide-icon">
						<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
							<path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"></path>
						</svg>
					</span>
					<h2>Qwant Search Engine</h2>
					<p>European privacy-first search with GDPR compliance.</p>
					<span class="guide-tag">Engine Guide</span>
				</a>

				<a href="/guides/mojeek-search-engine" class="guide-card">
					<span class="guide-icon">
						<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
							<path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20"></path>
							<path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2z"></path>
						</svg>
					</span>
					<h2>Mojeek Search Engine</h2>
					<p>The truly independent search engine with its own index.</p>
					<span class="guide-tag">Engine Guide</span>
				</a>

				<a href="/guides/presearch-search-engine" class="guide-card">
					<span class="guide-icon">
						<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
							<polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"></polyline>
						</svg>
					</span>
					<h2>Presearch</h2>
					<p>Decentralized search with crypto rewards and no tracking.</p>
					<span class="guide-tag">Engine Guide</span>
				</a>

				<a href="/guides/browser-extension" class="guide-card">
					<span class="guide-icon">
						<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
							<path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"></path>
						</svg>
					</span>
					<h2>Browser Extension</h2>
					<p>Install our Chrome extension to automatically filter AI from every search.</p>
					<span class="guide-tag">Extension</span>
				</a>
			</div>

			<section class="quick-start">
				<h2>Quick Start</h2>
				<p>Don't want to read guides? Just use Unslop Search:</p>
				<ol>
					<li>Go to <a href="/">unslopsearch.com</a></li>
					<li>Search for anything</li>
					<li>Get results without AI</li>
				</ol>
				<p>Want it as your default? <a href="/guides/disable-ai-overview-google#set-as-default">Set Unslop as your default search engine</a>.</p>
			</section>
		</div>
	</body>
</html>

<style is:global>
	* {
		box-sizing: border-box;
	}

	body {
		font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
		background: #1a1a2e;
		min-height: 100vh;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 40px 20px;
		color: #ccc;
		line-height: 1.7;
	}

	.container {
		max-width: 800px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.back-link {
		color: #4285f4;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		display: inline-block;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		transition: color 0.2s;
	}

	.back-link:hover {
		color: #6ba3ff;
	}

	h1 {
		color: #fff;
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
		font-weight: 300;
	}

	.intro {
		color: #888;
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		margin-bottom: 3rem;
	}

	.guides-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
		gap: 1.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 3rem;
	}

	.guide-card {
		background: #252542;
		border-radius: 12px;
		padding: 1.5rem;
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s, background 0.2s;
		position: relative;
		display: block;
	}

	.guide-card:hover {
		transform: translateY(-2px);
		box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
		background: #2a2a4a;
	}

	.guide-icon {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		width: 48px;
		height: 48px;
		background: rgba(66, 133, 244, 0.1);
		border-radius: 10px;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.guide-icon svg {
		width: 24px;
		height: 24px;
		color: #4285f4;
	}

	.guide-card h2 {
		color: #fff;
		font-size: 1.15rem;
		margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
		font-weight: 500;
	}

	.guide-card p {
		color: #888;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		margin: 0;
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	.guide-tag {
		display: inline-block;
		font-size: 0.7rem;
		padding: 3px 8px;
		border-radius: 4px;
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
		color: #888;
		margin-top: 1rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.5px;
	}

	.guide-tag.popular {
		background: rgba(66, 133, 244, 0.15);
		color: #4285f4;
	}

	.quick-start {
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
		border-radius: 12px;
		padding: 2rem;
		border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
	}

	.quick-start h2 {
		color: #fff;
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
		font-weight: 500;
	}

	.quick-start p {
		color: #888;
		margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
	}

	.quick-start ol {
		margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
		padding-left: 1.5rem;
		color: #aaa;
	}

	.quick-start li {
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.quick-start a {
		color: #4285f4;
		text-decoration: none;
	}

	.quick-start a:hover {
		text-decoration: underline;
	}
</style>
